        "title": "We’re serious about healthy hair, ask away",
        "q1": "What is Reniva?",
        "a1": "<p><strong>Reniva</strong> is a botanical-powered anti-hair fall shampoo formulated to strengthen roots, calm an irritated scalp, and help reduce daily hair fall — so you can hold onto the hair you have.</p>",
        "q2": "How do I use it?",
        "a2": "<p>Recommended use–</p><p><strong>Apply Reniva to wet hair</strong> and massage gently into the scalp, then rinse thoroughly. Use 3–4 times a week for best results.</p><p>Most customers report noticeably less hair fall within 2–4 weeks of consistent use.</p>",
        "q3": "What are the ingredients in this formula?",
        "a3": "<p>✅ Thuja Orientalis</p><p>✅ Hydrolyzed Oat Protein</p><p>✅ Ginger Extract</p><p>✅ Ginseng Extract</p><p>✅ Jojoba Oil</p><p>Free from harsh sulfates and parabens.</p>",
        "q4": "Can I use this while pregnant or breastfeeding?",
        "a4": "<p>Reniva is a topical shampoo, not an ingested supplement, and is formulated with gentle botanical ingredients. As with any new product, we recommend consulting your healthcare provider if you are pregnant or breastfeeding and have any concerns.</p>",
        "q5": "Will this cure or treat a medical condition?",
        "a5": "<p>No. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. It is designed to support scalp health and reduce hair fall with consistent use.</p><p>Always consult with your healthcare professional if you have an underlying scalp or skin condition.</p>",
        "q6": "What’s your money-back guarantee? I’ve wasted money on hair products that didn’t work before.",
        "a6": "<p>We offer a simple 60-day money-back guarantee.</p><p>If you don’t notice a reduction in hair fall within 60 days, just return the pouch.</p><p>No questions asked.<br/>Thousands of customers have tried Reniva, and most reorder before finishing their first pouch.</p>",
        "q7": "Other questions or concerns?",
        "a7": "<p>If you have any additional questions, concerns, or need further assistance, please contact us through our Contact page. Our support team is always happy to help.</p><p><strong>Support</strong></p>"
